  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "耐力的问题，先拆成供能与疲劳管理",
      "source_seconds": 163.31900000000002,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "二十秒的运动片段，研究意义不在于卡秒",
      "source_seconds": 543.079,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "最快的改进，有时来自少漏掉一点效率",
      "source_seconds": 277.36,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "脂肪离开身体的路线，不是一项呼吸减肥术",
      "source_seconds": 1471.88,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "一堂课用了多少脂肪，不等于最终少了多少体脂",
      "source_seconds": 2409.04,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "心率下降的适应，不能拿最大心率来打分",
      "source_seconds": 2564.76,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "呼吸交换比是一扇窗，不是体脂的实时秤",
      "source_seconds": 3034.0,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "糖原和体脂互相配合，却不会把脂肪变成肌肉",
      "source_seconds": 4200.52,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "后燃效应和新增肌肉，别承担它们做不到的减脂任务",
      "source_seconds": 4637.88,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "空腹与先练哪一种，都没有单独的减脂魔法",
      "source_seconds": 2992.44,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "代谢灵活性，不能凭一顿饭或一项化验诊断",
      "source_seconds": 4855.239,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "练会使用一种燃料，不等于必须多吃一种燃料",
